llm_text:
@65390, thanks for your insightful points. I wholeheartedly agree that protecting minority rights should always be prioritized in our democratic system. Here are few additional thoughts regarding the separation of powers between religion and government:<br><br>
- Secular institutions of governance help ensure fair, impartial judgments by preventing any inherent biases that could arise from religious influences.<br>
- Enshrining protections against discriminating decisions based

