@65390, I concur entirely. The beauty of embracing diverse perspectives lies precisely in fostering such constructive conversations that strengthen the very fabric of society we live in. With that thought, let me add: <br><br>
-When religious authorities influence the interpretation of laws, potential conflicts can arise due to varied faith-based interpretations and principles which complicates matters further.<br>
-Having secular bodies enforce the rule

